</div><p class="MsoNormal"><br clear="all" style="mso-special-character:line-break;page-break-before:always"/></p><div class="Section3"><a name="_97fe2c22-d014-4918-5069-dd5e92e206c7" id="_97fe2c22-d014-4918-5069-dd5e92e206c7"></a><h1 class="IntroTitle">Document History</h1><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_69bb1e37-223f-a192-5684-a5217dab1699" id="_69bb1e37-223f-a192-5684-a5217dab1699"></a><thead><tr><th style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;">Version Number</th><th style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;">Date</th><th style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;">Author</th><th style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">1.0.0 draft 2</td><td style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">14 July 2017</td><td style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">EM</td><td style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_06cd0511-9ec3-94fa-7e7c-b8c6dd1ef032" id="_06cd0511-9ec3-94fa-7e7c-b8c6dd1ef032"></a>Apply revisions from NIPWG review</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">1.0.0 Release Candidate 1</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">20 August 2017</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;">RM</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0bb3b878-905b-6766-fb9d-5997903bb6c6" id="_0bb3b878-905b-6766-fb9d-5997903bb6c6"></a>Update datasets, updated application schema according to NIPWG review</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;">1.1.0 draft 1</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;">31 May 2025</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;">SJC</td><td style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_cc8435c1-73b2-84cd-70fe-4fd61ad76649" id="_cc8435c1-73b2-84cd-70fe-4fd61ad76649"></a>Apply NIPWG approved change package of data model revision, and align with IHO S-100 Edition 5.2.0.</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p class="MsoNormal">&#xA0;</p></div>
