    </div>
    <div class="WordSection3_0">
      <div><a name="sec_10.3" id="sec_10.3"></a><h2>10.3<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Language</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4a5140fc-53b3-96bb-cb99-2a1d70b45adc" id="_4a5140fc-53b3-96bb-cb99-2a1d70b45adc"></a>The exchange language must be English. Other languages may be used as a supplementary option. National geographic names can be left in their original national language using the complex attribute <b>feature name</b>.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_86a534bc-49de-47a9-e64a-d61b64dcee07" id="_86a534bc-49de-47a9-e64a-d61b64dcee07"></a>Character strings must be encoded using the character set defined in  <a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/29819.html">ISO/IEC&#xA0;10646-1:2000</a>, in Unicode Transformation Format-8 (UTF-8). A BOM (byte order mark) must not be used.</p>
</div>
    </div>
    <div style="mso-element:footnote-list"/>
  </body>
</html>


